10	/**
11	 * {@code GET /api/invoices} — list every invoice, oldest first, each carrying the id of the project
12	 * it belongs to so the project-detail view can show just its own. Wired by
13	 * {@code officefloor/rest/api/invoices.GET.yml}.
14	 *
15	 * <p>An optional {@code sort=due} query parameter orders the list by due date (earliest first) —
16	 * this backs the sort-by-due-date control on the project invoices list. Any other value (or none)
17	 * keeps the stable oldest-first order.
18	 *
19	 * <p>Each invoice also carries its {@code amountDue}: the amount still owed after payments (its
20	 * amount minus every payment recorded against it). This is derived here from the payments — not
